  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Women for Better Reproductive Health Outcomes (EMPOWER)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Women for Better Reproductive Health Outcomes&#x201d; (EMPOWER) will contribute to (a) a reduction in preventable deaths of mothers, babies, and children, and (b) women and girls&#x2019; empowerment through choices about whether and when to have children and economic opportunities &#x2013; both UK priorities.  By the end of the programme, it will have averted over 2.4 million unwanted pregnancies and 3,700 maternal deaths.</narrative>
  </description>
